      "why": "The nine documents describe one OAuth scheme (each names the same authorizationUrl, app.hubspot.com/oauth/authorize, and tokenUrl, api.hubapi.com/oauth/v1/token), and each lists only the scopes its own operations' security names: the CRM object documents omit the crm.schemas.* scopes, Properties and Pipelines omit crm.objects.partner-clients.*, crm.objects.partner-services.*, crm.objects.products.read and crm.objects.commercepayments.read, Crm Owners lists four, and Oauth none. No list refuses a scope another grants, so the lists are partial catalogues of one scheme, not a contradiction: the scheme's scopes are their union (130 scopes), written here on the first document and copied to the other eight below. Evidence: the spec's own words, the Crm Owners document naming crm.pipelines.governance.write, which only it lists.",
      "source": {
        "spec": "/documents/owners/components/securitySchemes/oauth2",
        "quote": "crm.pipelines.governance.write"
      }
